OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh University lecturers
OL,4,Abegin five-week strike over cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FLecturers at the University of
OL,7,FEdinburgh have begun a five-week strike
OL,8,Fas part of a long-running dispute over
OL,9,Fbudget cuts and compulsory
OL,10,Fredundancies.
OL,12,FMembers of the University and Colleges
OL,13,Funion (UCU) - including university
OL,14,Fstaff and technicians - will not return
OL,15,Fto work until 30 October.
OL,17,FThe union said the cuts could lead to
OL,18,F1,800 job losses, and hundreds of staff
OL,19,Fhad already lost work when contracts
OL,20,Fwere not renewed. The university
OL,21,Fannounced the closure of 90 courses
OL,22,Fearlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
