OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh University lecturers
OL,4,Abegin five-week strike over cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincipal Prof Sir Peter Mathieson
OL,7,Faccused the union of "weaponising"
OL,8,Fstudents and insisted the university
OL,9,Fhad to take difficult decisions to
OL,10,Fsecure its future.
